    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a sales lead qualification assistant.\n\nAnalyze the lead information and qualify the lead.\n\nReturn exactly these fields:\n\nlead_score\ncategory\nreason\n\nRules:\n- lead_score must be an integer from 0 to 100.\n- category must be exactly one of: Hot, Warm, Cold.\n- reason must be one sentence.\n- Use only the information provided.\n- Do not invent information.\n- Do not add extra fields.\n\nEvaluate the lead using:\n1. Budget\n2. Business requirement\n3. Potential business value\n4. Clarity of requirement\n\nLead Information:\n\nName: {{ $('Clean Lead Data').item.json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $('Clean Lead Data').item.json.email }}\nCompany: {{ $('Clean Lead Data').item.json.company }}\nIndustry: {{ $('Clean Lead Data').item.json.industry }}\nBudget: {{ $('Clean Lead Data').item.json.budget }}\nRequirement: {{ $('Clean Lead Data').item.json.requirement }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
